Good morning,

Cascade Ridge School District 12 is soliciting competitive sealed bids from
qualified mechanical contractors for the Cascade Ridge Middle School RTU
Replacement project. Your firm has been included on our prequalified bidders
list for this solicitation.

PROJECT OVERVIEW
The work consists of the removal and replacement of fourteen (14) packaged
rooftop units serving the classroom wings and administration block, together
with associated ductwork modifications, new roof curbs and curb adapters, and
full integration of the new units into the District's existing building
automation system. Sheet metal transitions at each unit are included in the
base bid. No plumbing work is included in this package.

Trades required: HVAC, sheet metal, and controls.

PROJECT LOCATION
Cascade Ridge Middle School, Arvada, CO.

SCHEDULE
Mandatory pre-bid walk-through: September 11, 2026 at 9:00 AM local time.
Attendance is mandatory; bids from firms not represented at the walk-through
will be rejected as non-responsive.

Sealed bids are due no later than September 25, 2026 at 2:00 PM MT at the
District Administration Building. Late bids will not be opened.

Construction is scheduled to commence February 15, 2027 with substantial
completion required by July 30, 2027, prior to the start of the 2027-2028
academic year.

BUDGET
The District's engineer has established a construction budget of $850,000 for
this scope of work.

BONDING AND INSURANCE
A bid bond in the amount of 5% of the total bid is required with submission.
The successful bidder shall furnish a performance bond and a payment bond,
each in the amount of 100% of the contract sum. Contractors shall maintain
commercial general liability coverage with a limit of not less than
$2,000,000 per occurrence.

Please confirm receipt of this invitation and your intent to bid.

Regards,

Marguerite Delacroix-Whitfield
Facilities Contracting Officer
Cascade Ridge School District 12
